      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll write the improved test. The main issues in the original are:\n- Many unused imports\n- Unused constants (`YEAR_LEAP`, `STANDARD_YEAR_LENGTH`, `TEST`, `PARIS`)\n- The test intent is clear but can be made crisperThe improved test compiles successfully. The changes made were: removed all unused imports and unused constants (`YEAR_LEAP`, `STANDARD_YEAR_LENGTH`, `TEST`, `PARIS`), and added brief comments clarifying why `YEAR_STANDARD` is a non-leap year and why day 366 is expected to throw."
